@startuml
title Observation Unit Associations
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam roundcorner 0

class "SPU Observation Unit (SPUObU)" as OU <<Component>> {
  + observe(call, callback, sampling, subscription)
}
class "Observation Record" as OR <<Class>> {
  observationRecordIdentity
  observationInvocationIdentity
}
class "Observation Unit Association" as OA <<Association>> {
  observationUnitIdentity
  associationTargetIdentity
  observationUnitAssociationIdentity
  stepInstanceIdentity
}
class "Observation Target Scope" as TS <<Entity>> {
  target scope kind
  observation surface / events / state
}
class "Step Composition" as SC <<Component>> {
  + creates/changes/ends associations
  + sole authority
}

OU .. OA : participates
OA .. TS : observes exactly one scope
OA .. SC : managed by
OU --> OR : produces observation records
OR .. OA : retains association provenance historically
SC .> TS : target within owning Step

note right of OA : Association = applicability only
Does not guarantee active observation
Dissociation does not erase observation records

@enduml